WEBVTT

1
00:00:32.717 --> 00:00:36.864
<i>We've been in a relationship for six years.
Six years. I feel like throwing up.</i>

2
00:00:36.865 --> 00:00:38.864
<i>I'm the crazy one.</i>

3
00:00:38.865 --> 00:00:42.614
<i>Yeah, she was crazy,
so I broke up with her.</i>

4
00:00:42.615 --> 00:00:45.945
<i>We were so happy, so
we got married right away.</i>

5
00:00:56.396 --> 00:00:57.572
Wow, look at you!

6
00:00:57.573 --> 00:00:59.239
Congratulations!

7
00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:00.905
Our Na-ra looks gorgeous today!

8
00:01:00.906 --> 00:01:02.864
You're so pretty.

9
00:01:02.865 --> 00:01:05.489
- When is it our turn?
- Seriously!

10
00:01:05.490 --> 00:01:06.890
Let's get a picture first.

11
00:01:09.615 --> 00:01:12.590
Gone!

12
00:01:14.825 --> 00:01:18.773
Na-ra's gone to get married and I'm...

13
00:01:19.631 --> 00:01:21.189
gonna go to hell.

14
00:01:22.490 --> 00:01:25.905
Sure. You can go anywhere.

15
00:01:25.906 --> 00:01:29.447
Please, just get out of my bar.

16
00:01:29.448 --> 00:01:32.631
How could she get married within
two months after a blind date?

17
00:01:33.781 --> 00:01:37.879
His ex-girlfriend got married today.

18
00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:40.364
Apparently he's filthy rich.

19
00:01:40.365 --> 00:01:41.614
That asshole Tak-ho.

20
00:01:41.615 --> 00:01:46.280
His friend wants to go to hell, and
he's gonna stare at his phone all night?

21
00:01:46.281 --> 00:01:48.665
Well, he did bet his life on crypto.

22
00:01:48.666 --> 00:01:50.516
Even quit his job yesterday.

23
00:01:51.395 --> 00:01:55.865
See, I told you to be careful
about breaking up! Right?

24
00:01:55.866 --> 00:02:00.296
Grown man got cold feet
for failing your bar exams!

25
00:02:01.823 --> 00:02:03.215
Bro.

26
00:02:04.240 --> 00:02:05.947
I did it all for Na-ra.

27
00:02:05.948 --> 00:02:09.673
Stop making excuses, you idiot.
That's your insecurity talking.

28
00:02:23.615 --> 00:02:26.423
Ma'am, we are ready for you.

29
00:02:30.396 --> 00:02:32.655
Gone...

30
00:02:32.656 --> 00:02:36.156
Yo. Let's go. To the club, it's on me.

31
00:02:36.206 --> 00:02:38.081
- You're a check-n-block, bro.
- What's check-n-block?

32
00:02:38.082 --> 00:02:40.497
Check your face and blocked.
You won't even get in.

33
00:02:40.498 --> 00:02:41.914
- Then what do we do?
- Buy the whole club.

34
00:02:41.915 --> 00:02:43.539
- Buy it?
- Let's buy it.

35
00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:45.497
I'm going!

36
00:02:45.498 --> 00:02:48.681
Where do you wanna keep going?!

37
00:02:49.671 --> 00:02:51.930
The wedding. The bride.

38
00:02:51.931 --> 00:02:54.222
- Ugh...
- To steal the bride.

39
00:02:54.223 --> 00:02:59.274
You're too late, dumb-ass.
The wedding's over by now!

40
00:02:59.275 --> 00:03:02.166
Na-ra... I can't live without you.

41
00:03:02.931 --> 00:03:04.592
- I'll be back.
- Hey, hey!

42
00:03:04.593 --> 00:03:06.764
- You're too late!
- Seriously.

43
00:03:06.765 --> 00:03:09.097
- Hey! Dude!
- Geez... that dumb brat.

44
00:03:09.098 --> 00:03:10.430
Hey, go after him.

45
00:03:10.431 --> 00:03:12.482
Whatever. It's raining.

46
00:03:16.515 --> 00:03:19.781
Hong... Hong... Hong...

47
00:03:23.914 --> 00:03:27.222
Na-ra... I was just on
my way... to steal you...

48
00:03:31.656 --> 00:03:35.905
The taxi driver's waiting
outside. Go pay him.

49
00:03:35.906 --> 00:03:37.756
Oh... Okay.

50
00:03:47.114 --> 00:03:49.405
Was he really trying to come get me?

51
00:03:49.406 --> 00:03:50.530
Y-Y-Yeah.

52
00:03:50.531 --> 00:03:52.821
He wanted to crash
the wedding to steal you.

53
00:03:52.822 --> 00:03:54.196
- Was just heading out.
- Yes, really.

54
00:03:54.197 --> 00:03:56.756
What a coincidence.
Did you get scared too?

55
00:03:58.489 --> 00:03:59.714
Really?

56
00:04:03.697 --> 00:04:04.964
Na-ra.

57
00:04:07.156 --> 00:04:09.089
Forgive me.

58
00:04:22.781 --> 00:04:24.756
Don't be late next time.

59
00:04:26.656 --> 00:04:28.006
Okay.

60
00:04:34.697 --> 00:04:36.922
<i>Did I tell you I'm the crazy one?</i>

61
00:04:38.739 --> 00:04:41.922
<i>So did your wedding go smoothly?</i>

62
00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:47.203
Yeah, I just got here.

63
00:04:47.204 --> 00:04:48.483
I'm gonna be okay, right?

64
00:04:48.484 --> 00:04:52.821
<i>Of course, stop worrying.
Mom is already on our side.</i>

65
00:04:52.822 --> 00:04:56.196
I'm not gonna get a
face full of water, am I?

66
00:04:56.197 --> 00:04:58.155
What are you talking about?

67
00:04:58.156 --> 00:05:02.172
My mom is sweet, like a schoolgirl.
Like some lady next door.

68
00:05:08.072 --> 00:05:10.212
I've never seen a lady like
this in my neighborhood.

69
00:05:12.764 --> 00:05:17.072
I was curious who made my
daughter run away at the altar.

70
00:05:18.288 --> 00:05:19.388
Excuse me.

71
00:05:23.163 --> 00:05:26.370
In front of all those guests.

72
00:05:26.371 --> 00:05:29.870
Humiliating my family like that.

73
00:05:29.871 --> 00:05:31.346
I was curious...

74
00:05:33.038 --> 00:05:34.971
who he could be.

75
00:05:36.371 --> 00:05:37.471
I'm sorry!

76
00:05:39.871 --> 00:05:42.596
Drink. You look nervous.

77
00:05:49.038 --> 00:05:50.221
Thank you.

78
00:05:52.829 --> 00:05:55.804
Let me get straight to the point.

79
00:05:57.246 --> 00:05:58.537
Your job?

80
00:05:58.538 --> 00:05:59.838
I'm studying for the bar exam.

81
00:05:59.839 --> 00:06:01.231
Unemployed.

82
00:06:02.121 --> 00:06:03.963
Any money saved up?

83
00:06:03.964 --> 00:06:06.189
- Security deposit for my study room...
- Enough.

84
00:06:07.038 --> 00:06:09.388
I don't need to hear any more.

85
00:06:25.169 --> 00:06:28.136
Noh Jung-yeol, you're a smart man.

86
00:06:28.137 --> 00:06:30.987
So I'm sure you know what this means.

87
00:06:35.928 --> 00:06:39.570
I can't take this money.

88
00:06:40.803 --> 00:06:44.344
I beg of you to rethink this.

89
00:06:44.345 --> 00:06:46.653
Use this money for your new home.

90
00:06:48.428 --> 00:06:49.719
Huh?

91
00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:53.320
Put it towards the apartment
I've arranged for Na-ra.

92
00:06:59.095 --> 00:07:00.802
Thank you, mother-in-law.

93
00:07:00.803 --> 00:07:02.237
Mmm.

94
00:07:02.803 --> 00:07:06.886
Unpleasant to my ear, "mother-in-law".

95
00:07:06.887 --> 00:07:11.344
Just because I'm allowing it doesn't
mean I consider you my son-in-law.

96
00:07:11.345 --> 00:07:12.469
I understand.

97
00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:16.177
I'll work hard to be
accepted as your son-in-law.

98
00:07:16.178 --> 00:07:18.219
I'll consider you my son.

99
00:07:18.220 --> 00:07:19.903
Just call me "Mom".

100
00:07:23.553 --> 00:07:26.362
I have one last question.

101
00:07:27.553 --> 00:07:29.445
You're full of twists...

102
00:07:30.407 --> 00:07:32.632
You'll have to win over General Hong.

103
00:07:33.494 --> 00:07:36.660
Oh, father-in-law...
I mean, Dad, right?

104
00:07:36.661 --> 00:07:38.035
Die, you bastard!

105
00:07:38.036 --> 00:07:39.535
I love Na-ra!

106
00:07:39.536 --> 00:07:40.993
Please allow Hong Na-ra to marry me!

107
00:07:40.994 --> 00:07:43.743
I love her more! I love
her more, you filthy fuck!

108
00:07:43.744 --> 00:07:46.618
What's your deal?
Okay, we get it. Stop.

109
00:07:46.619 --> 00:07:48.315
Stop what? I'm not stopping shit!

110
00:07:48.316 --> 00:07:50.327
Daddy, stay tough.

111
00:07:50.328 --> 00:07:53.452
These idiots put a shit stain
on your 40-year military career.

112
00:07:53.453 --> 00:07:54.369
You, shut your mouth.

113
00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:56.243
You motherfucker!

114
00:07:56.244 --> 00:07:58.469
I love Jung-yeol more than you, Dad!

115
00:08:08.505 --> 00:08:09.772
Crazy bitch...

116
00:08:23.411 --> 00:08:24.803
Get up.

117
00:08:28.869 --> 00:08:30.386
Take your mother inside.

118
00:08:31.526 --> 00:08:33.590
- I'm gonna kill this dipshit.
- Dad, are you crazy?!

119
00:08:33.591 --> 00:08:36.118
Dad! You're being crazy! Dad!

120
00:08:36.119 --> 00:08:37.262
- Please shoot me!
- You asshole!

121
00:08:37.263 --> 00:08:39.036
- Just go home!
- If you won't approve...

122
00:08:39.037 --> 00:08:40.702
- Dad! Dad!
- Hey!

123
00:08:40.703 --> 00:08:42.077
Don't move, you chump!

124
00:08:42.078 --> 00:08:44.327
- Then I'd rather die!
- Open your goddamn eyes!

125
00:08:44.328 --> 00:08:46.035
- Dad!
- Bang!

126
00:08:46.036 --> 00:08:48.577
- Release your trigger finger!
- Hey!

127
00:08:48.578 --> 00:08:50.618
- I'll shoot you!
- I'm never giving up!

128
00:08:50.619 --> 00:08:52.327
I'll pull the trigger, scumbag!

129
00:08:52.328 --> 00:08:53.452
Shoot me!

130
00:08:53.453 --> 00:08:54.245
Bang!

131
00:08:54.246 --> 00:08:55.962
It's loaded!

132
00:08:55.963 --> 00:08:57.563
Just one shot!

133
00:08:59.119 --> 00:09:00.368
I'm okay with it!

134
00:09:00.369 --> 00:09:02.618
- Na-ra, I'll be fine!
- No, you are not!

135
00:09:02.619 --> 00:09:03.993
- Don't move, jackass!
- Dad, please!

136
00:09:03.994 --> 00:09:05.807
- You don't think I'll shoot you?
- Dad, stop it!

137
00:09:05.808 --> 00:09:07.712
I'm a three-star general, bitch!

138
00:09:07.713 --> 00:09:09.396
- Stop it!
- I'll shoot!

139
00:09:11.484 --> 00:09:14.077
<i>Dad should've shot him that day.</i>

140
00:09:14.078 --> 00:09:16.160
<i>He told me it was a blank.</i>

141
00:09:16.161 --> 00:09:18.285
<i>In the end, we got married.</i>

142
00:09:18.286 --> 00:09:22.928
<i>Since I blew up one wedding, we
had a small one with only family.</i>

143
00:09:24.536 --> 00:09:26.928
Is my granddaughter getting remarried?

144
00:09:28.751 --> 00:09:33.393
She's not getting remarried,
we're just having another ceremony.

145
00:09:37.960 --> 00:09:40.893
The groom is different.

146
00:09:42.293 --> 00:09:45.268
This guy, that guy,
they're all the same.

147
00:09:47.876 --> 00:09:50.435
I heard they were rich. Seems like it.

148
00:09:52.751 --> 00:09:54.500
Is that a mosquito net on her head?

149
00:09:54.501 --> 00:09:55.501
Shush.

150
00:09:55.502 --> 00:09:57.810
- That's a mosquito net.
- Stop it.

151
00:09:58.991 --> 00:10:00.875
Don't shush me.

152
00:10:10.128 --> 00:10:11.645
♪ Congrats ♪

153
00:10:14.168 --> 00:10:15.685
♪ Only a lil bit ♪

154
00:10:18.293 --> 00:10:21.101
♪ Don't fight ♪

155
00:10:22.293 --> 00:10:26.250
♪ Don't get divorced either ♪

156
00:10:26.251 --> 00:10:28.726
♪ My daddy ♪

157
00:10:30.418 --> 00:10:33.018
♪ Is a soldier ♪

158
00:10:34.335 --> 00:10:36.101
♪ You'll die ♪

159
00:10:38.489 --> 00:10:40.255
♪ You'll get shot ♪

160
00:10:42.543 --> 00:10:46.584
♪ I love you, I love you, ♪
♪ I love you, I love you ♪

161
00:10:46.585 --> 00:10:48.685
♪ I love you ♪

162
00:10:49.335 --> 00:10:50.667
Alright, here we go.

163
00:10:50.668 --> 00:10:52.976
One, two!

164
00:11:00.918 --> 00:11:03.875
<i>That really sounds like
something out of a movie.</i>

165
00:11:03.876 --> 00:11:05.280
<i>It still feels like one.</i>

166
00:11:06.460 --> 00:11:08.935
<i>Although the genre
turned into a thriller.</i>

167
00:11:12.543 --> 00:11:14.060
Ah, almost.

168
00:11:16.251 --> 00:11:17.851
You...

169
00:11:18.793 --> 00:11:21.185
You just tried to kill me...

170
00:11:23.126 --> 00:11:25.667
That's murder. Murder.

171
00:11:25.668 --> 00:11:28.667
Attempted murder, dumb-ass.

172
00:11:28.668 --> 00:11:31.459
Did you get your lawyer's
license from a raffle?

173
00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:32.552
So stupid.

174
00:11:32.553 --> 00:11:34.236
You freaking...

175
00:11:42.543 --> 00:11:43.419
Goddammit...

176
00:11:43.420 --> 00:11:44.851
Action!

177
00:11:48.159 --> 00:11:51.802
Why are you doing
this during work hours?!

178
00:11:51.803 --> 00:11:53.361
Sir...

179
00:11:54.668 --> 00:11:57.125
You're starting to
feel like a man to me.

180
00:11:57.126 --> 00:11:59.125
Do you really want
unemployment benefits?

181
00:11:59.126 --> 00:12:00.459
Choose.

182
00:12:00.460 --> 00:12:02.875
Fire me now...

183
00:12:02.876 --> 00:12:04.726
Or kiss me.

184
00:12:12.984 --> 00:12:14.875
- Cut!
- I'm sorry.

185
00:12:14.876 --> 00:12:16.084
Cut. Cut.

186
00:12:16.085 --> 00:12:17.552
That's a cut.

187
00:12:17.553 --> 00:12:19.792
Cut, cut!

188
00:12:19.793 --> 00:12:21.510
Sheesh... How many takes do we need?

189
00:12:21.511 --> 00:12:23.542
Take 13.

190
00:12:23.543 --> 00:12:24.941
I wasn't asking that.

191
00:12:24.942 --> 00:12:27.275
These actors can't even kiss properly.

192
00:12:27.276 --> 00:12:30.608
That's because you
changed the script on the fly.

193
00:12:30.609 --> 00:12:33.358
Maybe if you gave
them clearer directions.

194
00:12:33.359 --> 00:12:35.858
Hey, producer. Are you ignoring
me 'cause I'm a rookie?

195
00:12:35.859 --> 00:12:37.733
No, it's not like that.

196
00:12:37.734 --> 00:12:39.191
Director.

197
00:12:39.192 --> 00:12:43.334
Am I really kissing her because I don't
wanna give unemployment? That's kinda weird.

198
00:12:46.651 --> 00:12:48.525
Why don't you explain it to him?

199
00:12:48.526 --> 00:12:50.566
- Explain what?
- Your love story.

200
00:12:50.567 --> 00:12:52.021
It's well-known in the industry.

201
00:12:52.022 --> 00:12:56.451
You know, the kind of romance
that you and your husband share.

202
00:12:56.452 --> 00:12:59.463
What's so romantic
about being with that fool?

203
00:12:59.464 --> 00:13:01.233
<i>Noh Jung-yeol, Lawyer</i>

204
00:13:11.576 --> 00:13:13.593
All our clients keep looking for you.

205
00:13:14.333 --> 00:13:16.874
I'm flooded with work. Flooded.

206
00:13:16.875 --> 00:13:20.967
Isn't our firm going too far? I
need to renegotiate my salary.

207
00:13:20.968 --> 00:13:23.582
Ah, I'm so jealous.

208
00:13:23.583 --> 00:13:26.683
I want to establish myself
and get married too.

209
00:13:28.291 --> 00:13:29.867
What do you want?

210
00:13:29.868 --> 00:13:31.010
To get married.

211
00:13:34.541 --> 00:13:37.641
Just... date.

212
00:13:39.070 --> 00:13:42.204
Never mind, don't date either.
You might get married.

213
00:13:42.205 --> 00:13:43.805
<i>Lawyer's License Certificate</i>

214
00:14:00.224 --> 00:14:01.324
<i>Soju</i>

215
00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:04.040
Hong Na-ra!

216
00:14:04.041 --> 00:14:05.624
Are you kidding me?

217
00:14:05.625 --> 00:14:06.957
What is this?

218
00:14:06.958 --> 00:14:08.290
Are you crazy? Huh?

219
00:14:08.291 --> 00:14:11.249
Is this fridge your alcohol cabinet?!

220
00:14:11.250 --> 00:14:12.874
Are you the only one that's busy?!

221
00:14:12.875 --> 00:14:15.433
I'm busy too, I work my ass off!

222
00:14:37.962 --> 00:14:39.289
You too...

223
00:14:40.217 --> 00:14:41.885
I'm sure you know what I mean.

224
00:14:56.428 --> 00:14:57.683
What the fuck!

225
00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:00.350
He's like a mosquito.

226
00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.592
I have no clue why they exist,

227
00:15:02.593 --> 00:15:04.860
but they keep coming back
no matter how many I kill.

228
00:15:05.541 --> 00:15:09.040
They say God is fair. And he is fair.

229
00:15:09.041 --> 00:15:13.891
He gave me the intelligence and the
looks, but he gave me that woman.

230
00:15:16.200 --> 00:15:17.440
He said handsome.

231
00:15:17.441 --> 00:15:21.582
Hey. If you're handsome, 99% of
this country is Timothée Chalamet.

232
00:15:21.583 --> 00:15:23.749
Mmm, no idea who that is.

233
00:15:23.750 --> 00:15:26.374
He keeps doing this. How am
I supposed to live with him?

234
00:15:26.375 --> 00:15:28.332
"How am I supposed to live with him?"

235
00:15:28.333 --> 00:15:29.770
I told you not to do that!

236
00:15:29.771 --> 00:15:31.985
- You always whine, whine, whine, whine.
- Stop it.

237
00:15:33.382 --> 00:15:34.815
This is a court of law.

238
00:15:35.798 --> 00:15:39.214
Your love presented
you a movie-like wedding.

239
00:15:39.215 --> 00:15:41.922
How did you end up here?

240
00:15:41.923 --> 00:15:43.315
Movie-like...

241
00:15:44.132 --> 00:15:45.714
You know how it is.

242
00:15:45.715 --> 00:15:48.381
Once you hate someone, you can't
even stand the sight of them eating.

243
00:15:48.382 --> 00:15:51.631
Just wanna plug their nose
every time they breathe.

244
00:15:51.632 --> 00:15:54.006
Since when did it become like this?

245
00:15:54.007 --> 00:15:56.072
When all those
hateful feelings started?

246
00:15:56.073 --> 00:15:57.073
<i>Dung-yeol</i>

247
00:15:58.173 --> 00:16:01.047
Since we started
preparing for the wedding.

248
00:16:01.048 --> 00:16:06.256
Saying the apartment's too big for
the two of us, saying a studio is fine.

249
00:16:06.257 --> 00:16:09.047
The stinking pride of that man.

250
00:16:09.048 --> 00:16:14.006
He insisted he'll handle everything,
so he's still paying Mom back.

251
00:16:14.007 --> 00:16:16.189
- He reeks of inferiority complex.
- Yeah!

252
00:16:16.190 --> 00:16:17.839
What a nutjob.

253
00:16:17.840 --> 00:16:20.464
"Nutjob" is a bit harsh.
He's still Na-ra's husband.

254
00:16:20.465 --> 00:16:23.422
What's wrong, do worse. I'll allow it.

255
00:16:23.423 --> 00:16:25.839
Jung-yeol's a f*ckhead. That f*ck.

256
00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:30.506
